Leave questions and messages for me here. Put new messages at the top; makes &amp;#39;em easier to find.

----

LowPriorityStuff (an answer or decision next year is soon enough)

040905, MattisManzel: Hi Bill, sounds good. 

040522, JunkerIn: Sorry on the un-IDed change. I thought it had me logged in.

040122, JunkerIn, Suggestion: add automated outline page with links at page top with &amp;quot;AnCapWiki | RecentChanges | Preferences | Upload&amp;quot;. outline would just be the linked titles of each page with single- or double-space indents for each level. a quick &amp;amp; easy recursion should do it. Oh, recurses! Foiled again!

:040121, BillStClair (yes, I can answer JunkerIn on the day before he posted, because he lives seven hours ahead of me, hehe): I like the idea of an outline page, and I think I can put it in the header and footer, but I don&amp;#39;t know how to automate it short of writing lots of Perl code, which I&amp;#39;m not inclined to do. That leaves it as a task for a person, likely me, since I&amp;#39;m better at these kind of mindless tasks right now than at the actual writing, and I love how you&amp;#39;re doing that and don&amp;#39;t want to distract you with administrivia.

::still 040122, JunkerIn: 1) We *expect* more from the administrator. &amp;lt;g&amp;gt; 2. While it is not greatly important, I can convert to Central American Time. I used to report in Zulu time, i.e., GMT. 

::040122, BillStClair: 1) Gulp. 2) Heavens to Betsies. Don&amp;#39;t worry about it...

040120, JunkerIn, re:  UseModSetup. saw it, thought it related to my ealier request since erased by me, in any case, it helps, thank you.

:040121, BillStClair: glad to hear it.

re: Ama-Gi &amp;amp; Stylesheet Project. to not be impolite, i&amp;#39;m not ignoring, i like both ama-gi&amp;#39;s, but generally graphics &amp;amp; Stylesheet fancy I deem as ... unimportant? etc., etc. long diatribe on glitz ... so i&amp;#39;ll generally abstain. And of course, your site, your call. i&amp;#39;m glad i can just be of [http://www.yourgoogle.com&gt;google????]
