:040121, BillStClair: understood. I&amp;#39;m lousy at creating graphics and style sheets, but I appreciate them when they&amp;#39;re done well. Hence the projects, hoping that someone competent will step up. I don&amp;#39;t want glitz either, but good design actually makes a site easier to read.

---

040117: BillStClair

I put some wiki configuration advice at UseModSetup.

I&amp;#39;m not willing to call the new icon final yet. It&amp;#39;s a nice idea, but the image itself is sort of monochrome and boring. I want to see Matt Apple&amp;#39;s black and gold version, and maybe someone else will come up with something even more brilliant at AnCapWikiIconProject.

